                                "sense_id": "da2c5b79-4bf6-3eb4-a6f0-8f5dc9be4508",
                                "text": "Since [ö] could be spelt eu, ue, oe (§§ 11.8, 12.2) these graphies were at times confused, thus peut or poet for puet."
